  "batch": "f5b4783f-1fa9-4b1f-9e15-77a23f97121b",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nSoil moisture data derived from models or satellite remote sensing may have uncertainties\nrelated to soil texture maps, depth assumptions, and vegetation cover interference.\nUsers should be aware that \"root-zone\" definitions vary between models and may not\nperfectly match the specific rooting depths of all local crops.",
